		(property "Note" "Bidirectional, across the pair. Standoff has to clear the signal itself: VR amplitude is proportional to speed, about 20 V peak at 1500 rpm, so a part that clamps at 24 V would clip a runaway engine's own crank signal -- the one time the ECU most needs to keep counting teeth. 48 V clears 3600 rpm."
			(at 0 0 180)
			(layer "F.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
